To draw a chessboard in LaTeX, you can use the `skak` package, which is a LaTeX package for typesetting chess diagrams. Here is an example of how you can use it:

```latex
\documentclass{article}
\usepackage{skak}

\begin{document}

\newgame
\board

\end{document}
```

This will create a blank chessboard. To specify the FEN notation, you can use the `\setboard` command. For example, if you have a FEN notation like this:

